---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Projects — Hitarth Ghia" description="Production-grade network engineering and security automation projects: Async TCP Gateway, NeoShare HTTP Server, Modern-YTDLP-GUI, Bit-Blast Arena, and more.">

  <section class="section" style="padding-top: calc(var(--header-height) + 3rem);">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-header">
        <h1 class="section-title">Projects</h1>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Production-grade systems demonstrating network engineering depth and security automation breadth</p>
      </header>

      <!-- Featured Projects -->
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--fg-secondary);">Featured</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;">
              <div>
                <span class="tag tag-primary mb-2">C Systems</span>
                <h3 class="card-title">Async TCP Layer 4 Gateway</h3>
              </div>
              <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: var(--accent-primary-dim); border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--accent-primary); flex-shrink: 0;">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
                  <rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
                  <rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
                  <rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-description">High-concurrency asynchronous Layer 4 TCP gateway/proxy using epoll. Features round-robin load balancing, instant failover, async health checks with auto-recovery, IPv6 dual-stack, token bucket rate limiting (global + per-IP), and SIGUSR1 metrics observability.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-footer">
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag">C11</span>
              <span class="tag">epoll</span>
              <span class="tag">timerfd</span>
              <span class="tag">signalfd</span>
              <span class="tag">Python Tests</span>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
              <a href="/projects/async-tcp-gateway/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Case Study</a>
              <a href="https://github.com/HitroBro/async-tcp-gateway" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Source</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;">
              <div>
                <span class="tag tag-primary mb-2">Network Security</span>
                <h3 class="card-title">NeoShare Local Cloud</h3>
              </div>
              <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: var(--accent-primary-dim); border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--accent-primary); flex-shrink: 0;">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
                  <polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"></polyline>
                  <line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"></line>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-description">Zero-dependency HTTP file server built from scratch with Python stdlib. Threaded architecture, directory traversal protection, 2GB upload limit (DoS prevention), HTTP Range streaming for video seeking, auto tar.gz folder downloads, and auto dark/light theme detection.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-footer">
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag">Python 3</span>
              <span class="tag">ThreadingHTTPServer</span>
              <span class="tag">Zero Deps</span>
              <span class="tag">Range Requests</span>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
              <a href="/projects/neosahre/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Case Study</a>
              <a href="https://github.com/HitroBro/NeoShare-Local-Cloud" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Source</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;">
              <div>
                <span class="tag tag-primary mb-2">Automation</span>
                <h3 class="card-title">Modern-YTDLP-GUI</h3>
              </div>
              <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: var(--accent-primary-dim); border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--accent-primary); flex-shrink: 0;">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <polygon points="23 7 16 12 23 17 23 7"></polygon>
                  <rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-description">Multi-threaded desktop GUI for yt-dlp with custom Modern UI engine. Non-blocking I/O, real-time progress, format selection, playlist handling, and embedded ffmpeg — all in a responsive dark-themed interface.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-footer">
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag">Python</span>
              <span class="tag">Threading</span>
              <span class="tag">yt-dlp</span>
              <span class="tag">Custom UI</span>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1rem;">
              <a href="/projects/modern-ytdlp-gui/" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Case Study</a>
              <a href="https://github.com/HitroBro/Modern-YTDLP-GUI" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">Source</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Other Projects -->
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.25rem; margin: 3rem 0 1.5rem; color: var(--fg-secondary);">Other Projects</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;">
              <div>
                <span class="tag tag-primary mb-2">Game Dev</span>
                <h3 class="card-title">Bit-Blast Arena</h3>
              </div>
              <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: var(--accent-primary-dim); border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--accent-primary); flex-shrink: 0;">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                  <polygon points="10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8"></polygon>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-description">High-intensity retro space shooter with procedural game juice: screen shake, hit-stop frames, particle physics, boss mechanics with health bar and strafing AI, multi-layered parallax starfield, and persistent high-score tracking.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-footer">
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag">Python</span>
              <span class="tag">Pygame</span>
              <span class="tag">Procedural FX</span>
            </div>
            <a href="https://github.com/HitroBro/bit-blast-arena" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Source</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;">
              <div>
                <span class="tag tag-primary mb-2">Static Web</span>
                <h3 class="card-title">Blogger</h3>
              </div>
              <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: var(--accent-primary-dim); border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--accent-primary); flex-shrink: 0;">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
                  <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
                  <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
                  <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
                  <polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"></polyline>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-description">Multi-page static blog with responsive CSS, semantic HTML, optimized images, and clean typography. Pages: Home, About, Blog, Contact. Demonstrates frontend fundamentals without frameworks.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-footer">
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag">HTML5</span>
              <span class="tag">CSS3</span>
              <span class="tag">Responsive</span>
            </div>
            <a href="https://github.com/HitroBro/Blogger" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Source</a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="card">
          <div class="card-header">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;">
              <div>
                <span class="tag tag-primary mb-2">Web App</span>
                <h3 class="card-title">my-pg-project</h3>
              </div>
              <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: var(--accent-primary-dim); border-radius: var(--radius-md); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--accent-primary); flex-shrink: 0;">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                  <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"></line>
                  <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"></line>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-description">Booking and dashboard system with HTML/CSS/JS. Features: responsive layout, form validation, dynamic content rendering, and clean component structure. Early project demonstrating full-stack thinking.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card-footer">
            <div class="tag-list">
              <span class="tag">HTML</span>
              <span class="tag">CSS</span>
              <span class="tag">JavaScript</span>
            </div>
            <a href="https://github.com/HitroBro/my-pg-project" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Source</a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>